<h1>🚀 Sales / Business Management System</h1>
<p style="text-align:center;">
    A complete business management application built using <span class="highlight">Python, SQLite, and Streamlit</span>.
</p>

<div class="section">
    <h2>🌟 Key Features</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>✔ Product Management (Add, View, Update, Delete)</li>
        <li>✔ Customer Management</li>
        <li>✔ Sales Recording System</li>
        <li>✔ Automatic Stock Update</li>
        <li>✔ Dashboard Analytics</li>
        <li>✔ PDF Bill Generation</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>📦 Product Management</h2>
    <div class="box">
        <p>Manage all products with the following fields:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>ID</li>
            <li>Name</li>
            <li>Category</li>
            <li>Price</li>
            <li>Stock</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>👤 Customer Management</h2>
    <div class="box">
        <p>Store customer details including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>ID</li>
            <li>Name</li>
            <li>Phone</li>
            <li>Email</li>
            <li>Address</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>🧾 Sales Management</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Select product and customer</li>
        <li>Enter quantity</li>
        <li>Auto-calculate total amount</li>
        <li>Update stock automatically</li>
        <li>View sales history</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>📊 Dashboard</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Total Sales Amount</li>
        <li>Number of Products</li>
        <li>Number of Customers</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>🧾 PDF Bill Generation</h2>
    <p>Generate a downloadable bill including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Sale ID</li>
        <li>Product Name</li>
        <li>Customer Name</li>
        <li>Quantity</li>
        <li>Total Amount</li>
        <li>Date</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>🛠️ Technologies Used</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Python</li>
        <li>SQLite</li>
        <li>Streamlit</li>
        <li>Pandas</li>
        <li>ReportLab</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>⚙️ How to Run</h2>
    <div class="box">
        <p><b>Step 1:</b> Install dependencies</p>
        <pre>pip install streamlit pandas reportlab</pre>

        <p><b>Step 2:</b> Run the application</p>
        <pre>streamlit run app.py</pre>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
    <h2>🎯 Learning Outcomes</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Database operations (CRUD)</li>
        <li>Streamlit UI development</li>
        <li>Real-world business logic implementation</li>
        <li>PDF generation</li>
    </ul>
</div>

